      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Eliminating Hidden Surcharges &amp; Demanding Written Binding Contracts for Average Tariffs Rates Vehicle</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 16px;">In the world of vehicle transport services, there are certain tactics that dishonest transporters may employ to add extra charges to their customers' bills. These tactics involve inflating the charges for specific circumstances, such as floor elevations, long carries, or toll taxes. To better understand these practices, let's break down each situation:</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 20px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">01</div>
      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">1. Floor Elevations</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Some transporters may claim that a vehicle has to be lifted onto or off a truck due to high ground conditions or steep inclines. This, in turn, increases the risk associated with the transport and may lead to the addition of floor elevation fees. In reality, a professional transport company should have the necessary equipment, such as flatbed trucks or hydraulic lifts, to handle such situations without incurring additional costs. Transparent written binding quotes should clearly mention these fees, providing customers with accurate information about the costs involved in transporting their vehicle.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
      <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Verified Shree Ashirwad Standard</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">02</div>
      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">2. Long Carries</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">A long carry refers to the distance a vehicle needs to be loaded or unloaded from the truck. This can be caused by unusual locations or narrow roads, which, in certain cases, may result in extra charges. However, dishonest transporters may fraudulently inflate the distance or consider minor variations as long carries to add extra fees to the customers&apos; bills. Again, a transparent and binding quote should clearly outline the expected distances and procedures involved in transporting the vehicle, ensuring customers are aware of any potential additional costs.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
      <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Verified Shree Ashirwad Standard</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">03</div>
      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">3. Toll Taxes</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Some transporters may claim that tolls are incurred along the vehicle&apos;s route, resulting in additional fees. These fees can be particularly concerning when there is no proof of actual tolls being charged. In reality, transport companies should have a detailed route plan in place, taking into account toll roads and fees. If this information is provided transparently in the binding quote, customers can confidently understand the cost breakdown and avoid being caught off guard by unexpected toll charges.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
      <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Verified Shree Ashirwad Standard</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">04</div>
      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">To protect yourself from these tactics</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">it is crucial to opt for a reputable transport company that offers transparent written binding quotes. These quotes should outline all costs, including floor elevation fees, long carries, and toll taxes. By obtaining a comprehensive quote, you can determine if a company&apos;s charges align with the actual services provided.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
      <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Verified Shree Ashirwad Standard</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">05</div>
      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">Furthermore</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">ensure that the quote clearly specifies the route and transportation methods to be used for your vehicle&apos;s transport. This information will help you verify the authenticity of the charges and ensure that you&apos;re not paying for extra costs unrelated to the vehicle transport itself.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-size: 0.8rem; color: #10b981;">
      <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Verified Shree Ashirwad Standard</span>
    </div>
