  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 18px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
    <div>
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: #06b6d422; color: #06b6d4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 12px;">06</div>
      <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.4;">In conclusion</h3>
      <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">when searching for a reputable vehicle transport company, ask for a comprehensive and binding quote that includes all costs, such as floor elevation fees, long carries, and toll taxes. Always verify the company&apos;s route and transportation methods to ensure transparency and fair pricing. By taking these steps, you can protect yourself from deceptive tactics and enjoy a stress-free and cost-effective vehicle transport experience.</p>
